      "old": "using one original objective, feasible policy class and information\nset.",
      "new": "using one original objective and feasible action set, with common access to the economic primitives.",
      "reason": "The economic feasibility domain is shared, while individual representable policy classes and acquired information can differ.",
      "quoted_old_text_present_at_receipt": false
    }
